---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <!-- professional -->
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>you don't always need to know how, just why</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a developer who loves the humanistic side of user interfaces we are
      surrounded by. Every decision we make to design and engineer should follow
      our proposed theme and vision. There is great responsibility to
      encapsulate satisfying user experiences through our ability to create
      usable, intentional, and accessible interfaces. I find a lot of passion in
      the aspect of immersion.
    </p>
    <p>
      everything I know comes from my curiosity about why things work the way
      they do.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- personal -->
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>my curiosity flux</h1>
    <p>
      treating my voice like an instrument and mastering the art of
      communication, focusing on poise, eloquence, and influence
    </p>
    <p>
      transitioning from intermediate to advanced in the gym, mainly through
      intention and providing advice from a holistic perspective
    </p>
    <p>love introspective discussion about creative mediums</p>
    <p>
      solo travelling to fully immerse myself in something new while
      experiencing the emotions, thrill and stress that comes along
    </p>
    <p>
      utilizing AI tools to support learning, productivity, and help motivate my
      workflow habits
    </p>
    <p>
      appreciating the art of cooking, while balancing cooking just for
      'survival's sake'
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-40);
  }
</style>
